    "content" : "Figure 4. Example 3: Application to non-linear pendulum. ( a ) Schematic diagram: single pendulum ( top ) and double pendulum ( bottom ). ( b ) Scaled pixel data: single pendulum experiments ( left ) and double pendulum animation ( right ). ( c ) Data requirement: comparison between damped single pendulum and double pendulum. ( d ) SVD analysis: determining the number of algebraic constraints in the case of the chaotic double pendulum with degree 5 library."
